{"1821550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snapshot Aquarium", "steam_appid": 1821550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Aquarium</strong> is an aquarium sim with <strong>skill-based photo challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's for people who love fish and aquascaping—but want something more engaging than just feeding (or selling) fish every day. It’s calm, but not idle: patience and timing matter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot with patience:</strong> the photo mechanics reward waiting for the right moment, clean focus, and species combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build cozy habitats:</strong> keep your fish thriving and get a higher rank in the online gallery to draw more visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share &amp; explore:</strong> publish your tank and visit creations from players around the world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A long-term project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been tinkering on Snapshot Aquariumfor for over 10 years, and I’d love your support to keep adding features for many more. This is a calm, craft-at-your-pace project—built to grow with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the game today</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced fish AI - </strong>Schooling, fleeing, feeding, chasing, growing in near-realtime, basic needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aquarium editing - </strong>Over 300 items included already</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges </strong>- from easy (auto-aim, auto-focus), to expert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Community</strong> - Share your tank and visit others around the globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Gallery</strong> - Share your best shots online</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned / wishlist features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fish species, more plants, more decorations — more of everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >… and your suggestions are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love, peace and cheers, <br>Andy / Team Octoponx</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Aquarium</strong> is an aquarium sim with <strong>skill-based photo challenges</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's for people who love fish and aquascaping—but want something more engaging than just feeding (or selling) fish every day. It’s calm, but not idle: patience and timing matter.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot with patience:</strong> the photo mechanics reward waiting for the right moment, clean focus, and species combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build cozy habitats:</strong> keep your fish thriving and get a higher rank in the online gallery to draw more visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share &amp; explore:</strong> publish your tank and visit creations from players around the world.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A long-term project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been tinkering on Snapshot Aquariumfor for over 10 years, and I’d love your support to keep adding features for many more. This is a calm, craft-at-your-pace project—built to grow with the community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the game today</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced fish AI - </strong>Schooling, fleeing, feeding, chasing, growing in near-realtime, basic needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aquarium editing - </strong>Over 300 items included already</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style photo challenges </strong>- from easy (auto-aim, auto-focus), to expert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Community</strong> - Share your tank and visit others around the globe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snapshot Gallery</strong> - Share your best shots online</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned / wishlist features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More fish species, more plants, more decorations — more of everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More creative options (aquascaping)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community photo quests (find the fish!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >… and your suggestions are welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love, peace and cheers, <br>Andy / Team Octoponx</p>", "short_description": "Snapshot Aquarium combines aquarium simulation with skill-based photo shooting action. Build cozy habitats, visit other players’ aquariums, and take on photo challenges from easy to expert. Keep your fish happy to draw more visitors, or just dive into arcade-style photo play.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/87a43cb706f70ca667beea4d13c989255d6bcaf0/header.jpg?t=1771754136", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/39caa8b9b5f1a704629b499d38f8bf17468f3060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771754136", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1821550/39caa8b9b5f1a704629b499d38f8bf17468f3060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771754136", "website": "https://snapshotaquarium.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><str